( https://albiononline.com/news/crystal-raiders-coming )

Adventurer,

2024 starts with a bang for Albion Online, with *Crystal Raiders* on the ho=
rizon. Albion=E2=80=99s latest content update launches *January 8* , re-env=
isioning *Guild Seasons* with new systems and new rewards. To mark the upda=
te, we=E2=80=99ve produced a new trailer:

( https://youtube.com/watch?v=3DiPNZ5r8AEXw )

Constant Conflict
-----------------

*Territory Raiding* adds a new dimension to Guild Seasons, with the possibi=
lity to *steal Raw Siphoned Energy* from a rival guild=E2=80=99s territory =
outside of planned invasions bringing constant activity to Guild Seasons an=
d giving smaller guilds new opportunities to strike. Meanwhile, guilds rece=
ive Season Points and Siphoned Energy each day based on their territories=
=E2=80=99 stored Energy. And *Hideouts* =E2=80=99 effects are more closely =
linked to territory ownership, while long-standing Hideouts are more diffic=
ult to remove - rewarding those who defend their Hideouts and territories v=
igilantly.

( https://albiononline.com/update/crystal-raiders )

Rich Rewards
------------

New rewards bring greater incentives to individuals and groups throughout a=
 season. *Crystal Weapons* are crafted from Artifacts earned from Conqueror=
=E2=80=99s Challenge chests, with the first three arriving with this update=
: the *Infinity Blade* , *Rift Glaive* , and *Astral Staff* , each with its=
 own powerful spell. A *Daily Might Bonus* grants Might to players based on=
 the amount of Energy their guild siphons each day, encouraging consistent =
activity by individual guild members. And the *Conqueror=E2=80=99s Challeng=
e* awards a greater variety of chests based on both individual Might levels=
 and a guild=E2=80=99s Season Ranking, offering hugely valuable rewards to =
those who participate in a range of Guild Season activities.

( https://albiononline.com/update/crystal-raiders )

A Wealth of Improvements
------------------------

New, elite-level *Tracking* targets are being introduced which drop Silver =
and loot, broadening high-level group PvE options. A new *Region Quality Ov=
erlay* on the world map gives a convenient overview of the relative values =
of regions. *Balance changes* to weapons and *spell reworks* keep combat fr=
esh and unpredictable. And *UI and graphical improvements* make Albion=E2=
=80=99s gameplay experience smoother than ever before.

Crystal Raiders marks the beginning of a new era in Albion, with more frequ=
ent and focused content updates keeping the game fresh for all types of pla=
yers. For more on these changes, check out the *official Crystal Raiders up=
date page* :

LEARN MORE ( https://albiononline.com/update/crystal-raiders )

