<div>
<div>
<div>
<div>
<div>
<div>
<h3>Rich Rewards</h3>

<div>New rewards bring greater incentives to individuals and groups through=
out a season. <strong>Crystal Weapons</strong> are crafted from Artifacts e=
arned from Conqueror=E2=80=99s Challenge chests, with the first three arriv=
ing with this update: the <strong>Infinity Blade</strong>, <strong>Rift Gla=
ive</strong>, and <strong>Astral Staff</strong>, each with its own powerful=
 spell. A <strong>Daily Might Bonus</strong> grants Might to players based =
on the amount of Energy their guild siphons each day, encouraging consisten=
t activity by individual guild members. And the <strong>Conqueror=E2=80=99s=
 Challenge</strong> awards a greater variety of chests based on both indivi=
dual Might levels and a guild=E2=80=99s Season Ranking, offering hugely val=
uable rewards to those who participate in a range of Guild Season activitie=
s.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
