<h3>A Wealth of Improvements</h3>

<div>New, elite-level <strong>Tracking</strong> targets are being introduce=
d which drop Silver and loot, broadening high-level group PvE options. A ne=
w <strong>Region Quality Overlay</strong> on the world map gives a convenie=
nt overview of the relative values of regions. <strong>Balance changes</str=
ong> to weapons and <strong>spell reworks</strong> keep combat fresh and un=
predictable. And <strong>UI and graphical improvements</strong> make Albion=
=E2=80=99s gameplay experience smoother than ever before.</div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div>Crystal Raiders marks the beginning of a new era in Albion, with more =
frequent and focused content updates keeping the game fresh for all types o=
f players. For more on these changes, check out the <strong>official Crysta=
l Raiders update page</strong>:</div>
